  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO Consultancy for the Construction of an Education for Sustainable Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Given the global challenges posed by climate change, it is imperative to generate educational opportunities to consolidate a sensitive citizenship that can understand the problematic posed by global warming, while also having the capacity to propose and arrange adaptation and mitigation solutions. That is why, the following proposal seeks to design an educational program in sustainable development, aimed at generating skills for climate action in students from public schools in Bogot&#xe1;.</narrative>
  </description>
